          %h2#references References
          %ul
            %li#Ben91
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+B%C3%A9nabou"}> Jean Bénabou
                ,
                %em Some Remarks on Free Monoids in a Topos
                , pp.20-29 in LNM
                %strong 1488
                Springer Heidelberg 1991.
            %li#Blass
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andreas+Blass"}> Andreas Blass
                ,
                %em Classifying topoi and the axiom of infinity
                , Algebra Universalis
                %strong 26
                (1989) pp.341-345.
            %li#JT77
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Johnstone"}> Peter Johnstone
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topos Theory
            %li
              %p
                Hans-Joachim Baues, Mamuka Jibladze, and Andy Tonks,
                = succeed "," do
